raph\" ><strong>Make friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/4ade30f618b1c6c186f5770413382f58.poster.avif?t=1735998988\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/4ade30f618b1c6c186f5770413382f58.webm?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401110/extras/4ade30f618b1c6c186f5770413382f58.mp4?t=1735998988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
